+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+
+Defines how an order resolves its products and prices shipping and VAT, so that orders match the business rules in the README.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: SKUs are case-insensitive
+The system SHALL treat SKUs as case-insensitive and ignoring surrounding spaces when looking up a product, and SHALL show the SKU in upper case.
+
+#### Scenario: Lower-case SKU on an order
+- **WHEN** an order is placed with SKU `lb-220` and the catalogue holds `LB-220`
+- **THEN** the order is accepted and its line shows `LB-220`
+
+#### Scenario: Padded SKU
+- **WHEN** an order is placed with SKU ` lb-220 `
+- **THEN** it is the same product as `LB-220`
+
+### Requirement: Free shipping from €50.00
+The system SHALL charge no shipping when the goods amount, after every discount and before VAT, is €50.00 or more.
+
+#### Scenario: Goods exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** the goods amount after discounts is 5000 cents
+- **THEN** shipping is 0
+
+#### Scenario: Goods just under €50.00
+- **WHEN** the goods amount is 4999 cents
+- **THEN** shipping is charged by weight band
+
+### Requirement: Line VAT rounds half up
+The system SHALL compute VAT per line on its net amount and round half up to the cent.
+
+#### Scenario: Standard rate on €1.99
+- **WHEN** a line's net amount is 199 cents at 22%
+- **THEN** its VAT is 44 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line's VAT is exactly 0.5 cent before rounding
+- **THEN** it rounds up to 1 cent
